{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme", "label": "Epistemic Ledger POC \u2014 README", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Describes how the POC realizes the constitution; the constitution itself remains authoritative and is read first."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_product_bet_v4", "label": "Product Bet (v4) \u2014 Make AI Research Cumulative", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The POC does not bet on becoming a public truth network. It bets that AI agents increasingly do research that is expensive to repeat and hard to audit, so P0 must be useful to one person or team with no other contributors."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_core_principles", "label": "Core Principles (implementation summary)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sixteen principles condensed from the constitution, including 'determinism is not objectivity' and 'answers first, graphs underneath'."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_p0_definition_of_done", "label": "P0 Definition of Done", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Twelve capabilities ending in the hardest one: drop all projection tables, replay the log, and get the same snapshot hashes and scores."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_canonical_conventions", "label": "Canonical Conventions \u2014 Names, IDs, Snapshots, Enums, No Floats", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No synonyms anywhere: truth_score and belief_probability were naming drift that made the earlier spec ambiguous about what was being computed."}, {"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_reading_order", "label": "Reading Order and Precedence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Read either the numbered files or FULL-SPEC.md, never both, because duplication invited an agent to read everything twice and drift."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_product_bet_v4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_readme_core_principles", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/epistemic-ledger-poc-spec-v4/epistemic-ledger-poc/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc